        "TileImage": "$($repository 6981a514-1c41-4030-b8dd-08bd6ae8b4ab).Image",
        "Description": "Alright, this one is REALLY short and weird, we&apos;ve got a new client wich doesnt know much about assasination, he wants Empirio Torres, a man that bullied him when he was younger taken down.\r\rProblem is, you dont call an assasin to deal with these kind of issues.\r\rWe accepted his call because he paid us big, but we are also gonna take down Jeff the victim.\r\rYou may ask why ? Well this isnt the first time &quot;Jeff&quot; did this, he had differents identitites and did the same thing with other assasins.",
